sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as 买家
    participant P as portal-web
    participant BE as qiqi-mall-server(单体)
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over P,DB: 现状:商城与OMS揉在一个进程,无边界
    M->>P: 提交订单
    P->>BE: POST /portal/orders
    BE->>BE: OrderCreateService.create()<br/>=商城代码直接调OMS职责
    BE->>DB: 幂等+扣库存+写订单+写明细(一竿子到底)
    BE-->>P: 订单创建成功
    Note over BE: 问题:商城改版动订单逻辑<br/>OMS功能(审核/拆单)无处安放<br/>将来接淘宝订单?再写一个Controller?
